@baseUrl = https://localhost:7056
@processId = 1234
@sessionId = REPLACE_WITH_SESSION_ID_FROM_START


### Processes in the backend's Windows session (run backend inside VM)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audio/processes

### Select the audio application's real PID, including its child processes
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/audio/start
Content-Type: application/json

{"processId": {{processId}}}

### All sessions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audio/sessions

### One session
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audio/sessions/{{sessionId}}

### Recover chunks missed before SignalR join / during reconnect
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audio/sessions/{{sessionId}}/chunks

### Download first WebM
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audio/sessions/{{sessionId}}/chunks/1

### Stop and finalize pending audio
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/audio/sessions/{{sessionId}}/stop


